WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.460
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie, Big Channel
and Life Updates happening that I wanted to

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:07.430
tell you all about.

00:00:07.430 --> 00:00:09.530
Every thing is good news don’t worry.

00:00:09.530 --> 00:00:12.860
It’s just that because I already do so many
videos, it’s hard to fit extra stuff in

00:00:12.860 --> 00:00:16.150
that’s important but doesn’t have anything
to do with dragons, zombies, space ships or

00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:17.150
time lords.

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:21.000
So here’s what I’m going to do, first
I’ll let you know about the biggest changes

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.000
that have happened or are going to happen.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:29.060
Everything from the videos I’m doing to
physical changes to the Youtube platform.

00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:34.690
Second, I’ll let you know what’s going
on in real life behind the scenes here.

00:00:34.690 --> 00:00:38.910
I’m going to be making some big life changes
through the course of the year that will just

00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:42.100
make it easier to do what I love, which is
making youtube videos and hanging out with

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:43.100
you guys.

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:47.020
Then, because I totally don’t do it enough
I’m going to let you know which other youtubers

00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:48.989
I really like to watch.

00:00:48.989 --> 00:00:52.170
And other youtube related happenings that
I’m really excited about.

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:57.320
I feel like at some point I’ll have to create
a channel just for vlogging, but until my

00:00:57.320 --> 00:01:00.821
dream of becoming a space pirate comes true
I think it’s okay to just squeeze it in

00:01:00.821 --> 00:01:03.070
on Emergency Awesome every once and a while.

00:01:03.070 --> 00:01:06.460
So here we go, starting with new videos I’m
working on:

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:09.240
This weekend is the Walking Dead finale.

00:01:09.240 --> 00:01:13.290
If you’re not quite caught up, I recommend
you binge watch netflix, they have everything

00:01:13.290 --> 00:01:20.110
up to season 4, AMC is also running a marathon
of season 4 episodes to fill the gap.

00:01:20.110 --> 00:01:25.369
Everything else I do, Doctor Who, Arrow, Marvel,
Agents of SHIELD, and so on is staying the

00:01:25.369 --> 00:01:26.369
same.

00:01:26.369 --> 00:01:27.369
No changes there.

00:01:27.369 --> 00:01:35.100
But Game of Thrones is coming back April 6th,
so what’s going to happen is those videos

00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:38.259
will take the place of the Walking Dead videos
I would normally be doing.

00:01:38.259 --> 00:01:43.130
I’ll still do bonus videos for Walking Dead
just like I do for other favorite shows in

00:01:43.130 --> 00:01:44.270
the off season.

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:48.810
If there’s any particular type of bonus
videos you want to see, just leave me suggestions

00:01:48.810 --> 00:01:50.340
in the comments.

00:01:50.340 --> 00:01:55.680
In addition to swapping Walking Dead Sundays
with Game of Thrones, my weekly giveaway will

00:01:55.680 --> 00:01:57.540
be happening every week for each episode.

00:01:57.540 --> 00:02:00.070
There are 10 episodes, so that’s 10 more
weeks of giveaway.

00:02:00.070 --> 00:02:02.979
So now let’s talk about big Youtube changes
that have happened.

00:02:02.979 --> 00:02:12.730
Youtube itself has changed a lot about the
way it shows you guys new videos I’ve posted.

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:17.660
Most of the time it works okay, but sometimes
it’s an epic fail.

00:02:17.660 --> 00:02:20.840
So here are a couple of things you can do
just to make sure you don’t miss out on

00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:23.730
giveaways or new videos.

00:02:23.730 --> 00:02:30.670
There are two different layouts you guys might
be seeing, but youtube calls this “The Guide”.

00:02:30.670 --> 00:02:34.470
This is where most of you see my new videos
show up.

00:02:34.470 --> 00:02:38.750
Go to the ‘My Subscriptions Tab’, which,
depending on your layout is over here on the

00:02:38.750 --> 00:02:39.750
left hand side.

00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:41.930
Or up at the top of your home page.

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:45.760
Inside your subscriptions page you can just
mouse over one of my videos and select “Get

00:02:45.760 --> 00:02:48.620
An Email” for each upload from Emergency
Awesome.

00:02:48.620 --> 00:02:56.330
I typically post about 10 videos a week, so
this is the only way to guarantee you don’t

00:02:56.330 --> 00:02:57.380
miss stuff.

00:02:57.380 --> 00:03:01.909
I know a lot of you are international, so
there’s a huge time zone difference and

00:03:01.909 --> 00:03:05.060
sometimes I end up posting videos while you’re
asleep.

00:03:05.060 --> 00:03:08.530
As much as youtube does weird things to change
how everything looks.

00:03:08.530 --> 00:03:11.750
This is one feature that is amazing, but that
a lot of you might not know about.

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:16.270
So for example, I have about 30 youtubers
I subscribe to, but I want to get alerts for

00:03:16.270 --> 00:03:19.909
my favorites like vlogbrothers and DFTBA stuff.

00:03:19.909 --> 00:03:23.750
So for them I enable this email alert and
for everyone else, I just leave it on the

00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:24.750
default.

00:03:24.750 --> 00:03:26.640
There’s also the tried and true refresh
method, where I just sit on their youtube

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:27.640
pages and refresh until they post new videos.

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:29.379
I know some of you like to do this too.

00:03:29.379 --> 00:03:30.540
It’s an oldie but a goodie.

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:34.459
Personally I would recommend just enabling
email alerts and saving yourself the trouble.

00:03:34.459 --> 00:03:39.159
If you’re not a big email person, or you
just want to talk to me off youtube there’s

00:03:39.159 --> 00:03:40.159
social.

00:03:40.159 --> 00:03:44.769
I’m most active on Twitter, Facebook, Tumblr,
Instagram and Google plus.

00:03:44.769 --> 00:03:46.840
Here’s the links for all those accounts.

00:03:46.840 --> 00:03:49.870
There’s also links at the top of my channel
page here.

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:54.420
I wasn’t able to fit my entire name on twitter,
so that’s a little different.

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:58.840
But for the most part, I’m Emergency Awesome
everywhere.

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:01.840
So if it’s the middle of the day and you
just want to say hi, you can always tweet

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:04.060
at me or post on my facebook page.

00:04:04.060 --> 00:04:08.439
I read all the youtube comments, but here’s
where I need to mention Google Plus, because

00:04:08.439 --> 00:04:11.159
it does affect which comments I see at the
top.

00:04:11.159 --> 00:04:14.849
If you haven’t heard about it, Google Plus
created this thing on youtube called Top Fans.

00:04:14.849 --> 00:04:26.530
It’s just a way to benefit the people who
engage with me the most on my videos.

00:04:26.530 --> 00:04:30.940
In the future, I’m going to do some exclusive
giveaways, google hangouts and there might

00:04:30.940 --> 00:04:35.940
be free t-shirts at some point.

00:04:35.940 --> 00:04:46.020
The easiest way to jump to the top of that
list is to follow me on google plus.

00:04:46.020 --> 00:04:51.320
I do like Google Plus, but it’s mostly helpful
for managing comments.

00:04:51.320 --> 00:04:55.900
Also, because of google plus, now if you want
to make sure I see you’re comment.

00:04:55.900 --> 00:05:01.370
All you have to do is add the “+” symbol
in front of my name and it will ‘mention’

00:05:01.370 --> 00:05:02.370
me.

00:05:02.370 --> 00:05:04.180
It’s like mentioning someone on twitter.

00:05:04.180 --> 00:05:10.380
I still read all the comments on videos no
matter what, but when you add that + it send

00:05:10.380 --> 00:05:12.630
it directly to my gmail.

00:05:12.630 --> 00:05:14.750
So that pretty much covers all the big youtube
changes.

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:16.759
Like I said, it breaks a lot, but it’s a
free platform and all my social accounts allow

00:05:16.759 --> 00:05:19.100
me to talk with you guys when youtube does
fail.

00:05:19.100 --> 00:05:21.230
Here’s what’s going on behind the scenes
in real life.

00:05:21.230 --> 00:05:26.100
I am still working at my full time job, I
may be turning full time creator by the end

00:05:26.100 --> 00:05:27.280
of the year.

00:05:27.280 --> 00:05:31.430
Which is my dream.

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:35.870
I’ll definitely let you guys know if that
happens sooner.

00:05:35.870 --> 00:05:37.790
Because we will be poppin’ bottles.

00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:40.139
In the short term, I am still looking for
a new apartment.

00:05:40.139 --> 00:05:44.690
I have to reloacte the TARDIS to somewhere
a little bigger just to make it easier to

00:05:44.690 --> 00:05:46.260
shoot youtube videos.

00:05:46.260 --> 00:05:48.370
Probably sometime this summer before Comic
Con.

00:05:48.370 --> 00:05:52.949
I’ll be sure to do a room tour once I get
everything set up.

00:05:52.949 --> 00:05:57.990
I’ll be getting some extra gear that will
make it easier to do live streams, but there’s

00:05:57.990 --> 00:06:00.040
a lot of technical stuff involved.

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:04.389
So for example during the fall you might see
me do Live Doctor Who and Walking Dead videos.

00:06:04.389 --> 00:06:05.930
Which I’m excited to try.

00:06:05.930 --> 00:06:10.410
So if you have any questions about videos
coming up that I’ll be doing or just stuff

00:06:10.410 --> 00:06:13.360
that’s going on in my life, just write it
in the comments.

00:06:13.360 --> 00:06:16.250
Or feel free to high five me on twitter.

00:06:16.250 --> 00:06:20.410
If you’re just now finding me and you have
no idea what’s going on, be sure to Subscribe

00:06:20.410 --> 00:06:21.780
below to get all my stuff.

00:06:21.780 --> 00:06:23.970
There are dragons coming next week.

00:06:23.970 --> 00:06:30.440
Here’s a couple other youtube things that
are happening in the near future that I’m

00:06:30.440 --> 00:06:32.009
really excited about including conventions.

00:06:32.009 --> 00:06:37.020
I’ll be at Wondercon at the end of April,
I’ll be at VidCon at the end of June and

00:06:37.020 --> 00:06:39.400
I’ll be at Comic Con at the end of July.

00:06:39.400 --> 00:06:43.620
I might also be doing a panel at Comic Con,
but I don’t know what’s happening, so

00:06:43.620 --> 00:06:45.550
I’ll post updates when it’s all figured
out.

00:06:45.550 --> 00:06:48.724
Here are a few youtubers that you may already
know about, but that I spend a lot of time

00:06:48.724 --> 00:06:49.724
watching when I’m not making my own videos.

00:06:49.724 --> 00:06:51.940
First is Hank and John Green.

00:06:51.940 --> 00:06:54.229
Most of the time I watch their vlogbrothers
videos.

00:06:54.229 --> 00:06:58.419
But I also subscribe to all their DFTBA channels
like scishow and the new scishowspace.

00:06:58.419 --> 00:07:00.360
They’re going to be doing cool space stuff
there.

00:07:00.360 --> 00:07:04.310
Then there’s Vsauce with Michael, I actually
used to work with him on Barely Political

00:07:04.310 --> 00:07:08.730
videos in the early days of youtube.

00:07:08.730 --> 00:07:15.169
And for video game stuff I’m a big fan of
Pewds like the rest of the world and smaller

00:07:15.169 --> 00:07:21.539
creators like Dodger on her Dexterity Bonus
and PressHeart channels.

00:07:21.539 --> 00:07:26.440
So remember, Walking Dead finale sunday.

00:07:26.440 --> 00:07:33.550
Click here for my final predictions and click
here to start getting ready for Game of Thrones.

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:38.449
Thanks for watching, see you guys tomorrow.

00:07:38.449 --> 00:07:39.189
High Fives!

